OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredibly special' - William
OL,4,Areveals his favourite view from first
OL,5,Ahome with Catherine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Prince of Wales has named the view
OL,8,Ffrom his former home on Anglesey as his
OL,9,Ffavourite view in Britain.
OL,11,FIn a guest edition of Country Life
OL,12,Fmagazine, Prince William recalled
OL,13,Fliving in Bodowen Farmhouse, on the
OL,14,FBodorgan Estate in north Wales, soon
OL,15,Fafter he and Catherine, Princess of
OL,16,FWales, were first married.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
